{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-20-1","title":"Revelation 20:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Satan bound for a thousand years. 6 The first resurrection; they blessed that have part therein. 7 Satan let loose again. 8 Gog and Magog. 10 The devils cast into the lake of fire and brimstone. 12 The last and general resurrection.</p>\n<p>I saw. 10:1; 18:1 having. 1:18; 9:1,2; Lu 8:31 a great. 2Pe 2:4; Jude 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-2","title":"Revelation 20:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>he laid. Ge 3:15; Isa 27:1; 49:24,25; Mt 8:29; 19:29; Mr 5:7; Lu 11:20-22 Joh 12:31; 16:11; Ro 16:20; Heb 2:14 the dragon. 9:11; 12:9,13,15,17; 13:2,4; Job 1:7; 2:1,2; 1Pe 5:8; 2Pe 2:4; Jude 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-3","title":"Revelation 20:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>cast. 1; 17:8 and set. Da 6:17; Mt 27:66 should deceive. 8; 12:9; 13:14; 16:14-16; 17:2; Mt 24:24; 2Co 11:3,13-15; 2Th 2:9-11 the thousand. Ps 90:4; 2Pe 3:8 and after. 7-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-4","title":"Revelation 20:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>thrones. Da 7:9,18,22,27; Mt 19:28; Lu 22:30; 1Co 6:2,3 the souls. 6:9; Mal 4:5; Mt 17:10-13; Mr 9:11; Lu 1:17; 9:7-9 beheaded. Mt 24:10; Mr 6:16,27; Lu 9:9 the witness. 1:9; 11:3,7; 12:11 and which. 13:12-17; 14:11; 15:2; 17:8 and they. 5:9; 11:11,15; Da 2:44; 7:18,27; Ro 8:17; 11:15; 2Ti 2:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-5","title":"Revelation 20:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>the rest. 8,9; 19:20,21 This. 11:11,15; Eze 37:2-14; Ro 11:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-6","title":"Revelation 20:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Blessed. 5; 14:13; 22:7; Isa 4:3; Da 12:12; Lu 14:15 the second. 14; 2:11; 21:8 priests. 1:6; 5:10; Isa 61:6; Ro 12:1; 1Pe 2:5,9 and shall. 4; 1:6; 5:10; Ro 8:17; 2Ti 2:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-8","title":"Revelation 20:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>to deceive. 3,10 Gog. Eze 38:1-39:29 to gather. 16:14 the number. Jud 7:12; 1Sa 13:5; 1Ki 4:20; Isa 10:22; Jer 33:22; Heb 11:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-9","title":"Revelation 20:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>went. Isa 8:7,8; Eze 38:9,16; Hab 1:6 and compassed. 2Ki 6:15; Mic 2:13; Mt 16:16-18; Lu 19:43; 21:20 the camp. Ps 48:1-3; 74:2-4; 125:1,2; Heb 13:13 and fire. 11:5; 13:13; Ge 19:24; Ex 9:23,24; Le 10:2,3; Nu 11:1; 16:35 2Ki 1:10-15; Ps 97:3; 106:18; Isa 30:33; 37:36; Eze 38:22; 39:6 Lu 9:54; 17:29; 2Th 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-10","title":"Revelation 20:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>the devil. 2,3,8 the lake. 14,15; 19:20 tormented. 14:10; Mt 25:41,46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-11","title":"Revelation 20:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>I saw. 2; 19:11; Ge 18:25; Ps 9:7,8; 14:6,7; 47:8; 89:14; 97:2; Mt 25:31 Ac 17:30,31; Ro 2:5 from. 6:14; 16:20; 21:1; Jer 4:23-26; Da 2:35; Mt 24:35; 2Pe 3:7,10-12 and there. 12:8; Job 9:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-12","title":"Revelation 20:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>I saw. 11; Da 12:2; Joh 5:28,29; 11:25,26; Ac 24:15; 1Co 15:21-23 1Th 4:15-17 small. 19:5 stand. Ro 14:10-12; 1Co 4:5; 2Co 5:10 the books. Da 7:10 and another. 3:5; 13:8; 17:8; 21:27; Ps 69:28; Da 12:1; Lu 10:20; Php 4:3 according. 13; 2:23; 22:12; Ps 28:4; 62:12; Pr 24:12,29; Ec 12:14; Jer 17:10 Jer 32:19; Mt 16:27; Ro 2:6; 2Co 5:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-13","title":"Revelation 20:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the sea. Joh 5:28,29 and death. 14; 6:8; Ho 13:14; 1Co 15:50-58 hell. or, the grave. 1Co 15:55; *marg: and they. 12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-14","title":"Revelation 20:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>death. 19:20; Ho 13:14; 1Co 15:26,53 This. 6; 21:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-20-15","title":"Revelation 20:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>whosoever. Mr 16:16; Joh 3:18,19,36; 14:6; Ac 4:12; Heb 2:3; 12:25; 1Jo 5:11,12 was cast. 19:20; Mt 25:41; Mr 9:43-48</p>"}]}